\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"logo\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:05:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:05:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"TSK-2026-0003\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Review weekly entries\\\",\\n      \\\"title_bn\\\": \\\"সাপ্তাহিক এন্ট্রি পর্যালোচনা\\\",\\n      \\\"desc\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"doing\\\",\\n      \\\"priority\\\": \\\"medium\\\",\\n      \\\"due\\\": \\\"2026-10-01\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"review\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"weekly\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:10:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:10:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"notes\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"NOT-2026-0001\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"How this system works\\\",\\n      \\\"title_bn\\\": \\\"এই সিস্টেম যেভাবে কাজ করে\\\",\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"index.html never changes. Add data with the scripts; the page reads data.json.\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"guide\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"guide\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"pinned\\\": true,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:15:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:15:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"NOT-2026-0002\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"ID format\\\",\\n      \\\"title_bn\\\": \\\"আইডি ফরম্যাট\\\",\\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"TSK / NOT / AUD + year + serial. IDs are never reused.\\\",\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"guide\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"id\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"pinned\\\": false,\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:20:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T09:20:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"audits\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"AUD-2026-0001\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Data integrity check\\\",\\n      \\\"title_bn\\\": \\\"ডাটা ইন্টিগ্রিটি যাচাই\\\",\\n      \\\"result\\\": \\\"pass\\\",\\n      \\\"target\\\": \\\"data.json\\\",\\n      \\\"findings\\\": \\\"No duplicate IDs.\\\",\\n      \\\"auditor\\\": \\\"MJ Ahmad\\\",\\n      \\\"related\\\": [\\n        \\\"TSK-2026-0001\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"system\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"integrity\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T10:10:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T10:10:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"AUD-2026-0002\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Logo file present\\\",\\n      \\\"title_bn\\\": \\\"লোগো ফাইল আছে কিনা\\\",\\n      \\\"result\\\": \\\"warning\\\",\\n      \\\"target\\\": \\\"assets/logo.png\\\",\\n      \\\"findings\\\": \\\"Logo not yet added.\\\",\\n      \\\"auditor\\\": \\\"MJ Ahmad\\\",\\n      \\\"related\\\": [\\n        \\\"TSK-2026-0002\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"category\\\": \\\"system\\\",\\n      \\\"tags\\\": [\\n        \\\"logo\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T10:12:00+06:00\\\",\\n      \\\"history\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"at\\\": \\\"2026-09-24T10:12:00+06:00\\\",\\n          \\\"event\\\": \\\"created\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"codes\\\": []\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\nCodeCraft যুক্ত করেছি। স্ক্রিপ্টগুলো একটি কপিতে আপনার উদাহরণের মতো করে চালিয়ে পরীক্ষা করেছি, আইডি, মেনু ও validate ঠিক কাজ করেছে। CodeCraft-এর কার্ড আর মেনু ব্রাউজারে খুলে দেখিনি, শুধু JavaScript-এর সিনট্যাক্স যাচাই করেছি।\\n\\n**ব্যবহার**\\n```\\n./run.sh code ~/mj/portal/index.html \\\"Title\\\" \\\"Description\\\" --bn \\\"শিরোনাম\\\" --bn \\\"বর্ণনা\\\"\\n./add_code.py https://example.com/app.py \\\"API script\\\"     # লিংক থেকেও চলে\\n./add_code.py                                              # আর্গুমেন্ট ছাড়া = প্রশ্নোত্তর মোড\\n```\\nপ্রথম `--bn` শিরোনামের বাংলা, দ্বিতীয় `--bn` বর্ণনার বাংলা। চাইলে `--title-bn` ও `--desc-bn` আলাদা করেও দেওয়া যায়। শিরোনাম না দিলে ফাইলের নামই শিরোনাম হয়।\\n\\n**কী ঘটে**\\n- পুরো ফাইলের কনটেন্ট `data.json`-এর `codes`-এ যায় এবং আইডি হয় `CDE-2026-0001` ধরনের।\\n- ফাইলের ধরন এক্সটেনশন বা shebang দেখে চেনা হয় (HTML, JSON, Python, Node.js, Shell, CSS, TypeScript, SQL ইত্যাদি)। ভুল ধরা পড়লে `--lang python` দিয়ে ঠিক করা যায়।\\n- CodeCraft মেনুর নিচে ওই ধরনের সাব-মেনু নিজে থেকে তৈরি হয়, যেমন CodeCraft → HTML।\\n- একই কনটেন্ট দ্বিতীয়বার দিলে আটকে দেয়, `--force` দিলে যুক্ত হয়। ২ MB-র বড় বা বাইনারি ফাইল নেয় না।\\n\\n**দেখতে যেমন**\\n- কার্ডের এক পাশে ধরনের রঙিন ব্যাজ, অন্য পাশে **Copy** (পুরো কোড কপি হয়) ও ডাউনলোড বোতাম।\\n- কোড ডার্ক প্যানেলে লাইন নম্বরসহ শুরুতে ৪ লাইন দেখায়। ওই সংখ্যা `data.json`-এর `meta.code_preview_lines` থেকে বদলানো যায়।\\n- **Show all** বা কোডের অংশে ক্লিক করলে পুরোটা খোলে, **Collapse** চাপলে আগের অবস্থায় ফেরে।\\n- ড্যাশবোর্ড, সার্চ ও রেজিস্ট্রিতেও CodeCraft আসে। EN|BN টগল এখানেও কাজ করে।\\n\\n`index.html`-এ CodeCraft দেখানোর জন্য শেষবারের মতো একটি বদল করা হয়েছে। এরপর নতুন ধরনের ফাইল যোগ করলেও এটি বদলাতে হবে না। আপডেট হয়েছে `index.html`, `add_code.py` (নতুন), `_lib.py`, `validate.py`, `run.sh` ও `data.json`। আপনার `data.json`-এ নিজের এন্ট্রি থাকলে রিপ্লেস না করে তিনটি জিনিস হাতে যোগ করুন: `\\\"codes\\\": []`, মেনুতে `codecraft` নোড, আর `meta.counters`-এ `\\\"code\\\": {}`।\\n\\n---\\n\\n\\n\",\n      \"menu_path\": [\n        \"codecraft\",\n        \"c-markdown\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"CDE-2026-0003\",\n      \"title\": \"MJ Central json\",\n      \"title_bn\": \"\",\n      \"desc\": \"\",\n      \"desc_bn\": \"\",\n      \"filename\": \"mj.json\",\n      \"source\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mj.json\",\n      \"lang\": \"json\",\n      \"lang_label\": \"JSON\",\n      \"ext\": \"json\",\n      \"lines\": 147,\n      \"bytes\": 3986,\n      \"sha256\": \"7394034067460054c288fff35caf925b42a3377c9035a62198b9828dc6c3872a\",\n      \"menu_path\": [\n        \"codecraft\",\n        \"c-mjdocs\"\n      ],\n      \"category\": \"general\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-25T03:10:51+06:00\",\n      \"history\": [\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-25T03:10:51+06:00\",\n          \"event\": \"created\",\n          \"note\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mj.json\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content\": \"{\\n  \\\"meta\\\": {\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"MJ-Ahmad Documentation Hub — Constitutional Index\\\",\\n    \\\"curated_by\\\": \\\"MJ Ahmad — Steward of Ethical Inheritance\\\",\\n    \\\"document_type\\\": \\\"System Index\\\",\\n    \\\"last_updated\\\": \\\"October 19, 2025\\\",\\n    \\\"declaration\\\": \\\"This index is not a directory. It is a declaration — that every module, every steward, and every learner deserves clarity, dignity, and traceable inheritance.\\\",\\n    \\\"quote\\\": {\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"Let no file be lost, no steward forgotten, and no learner left behind.\\\",\\n      \\\"author\\\": \\\"MJ Ahmad\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"modules\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🏛️ Core Modules\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Constitution\\\",\\n        \\\"Whitepaper\\\",\\n        \\\"Roadmap\\\",\\n        \\\"Glossary\\\",\\n        \\\"Contributor Registry\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🧠 Logic & Ethics\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"NXN Genesis\\\",\\n        \\\"Ethics Manifesto\\\",\\n        \\\"Violation Ledger\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🧾 Governance\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Role Activation\\\",\\n        \\\"Voting Policy\\\",\\n        \\\"Emergency Protocol\\\",\\n        \\\"Ratification Ledger\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🧠 Behavioral Governance\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Persona Consistency and Ethical Tone\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🛡️ Security Protocols\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Threat Model\\\",\\n        \\\"Incident Response\\\",\\n        \\\"Guardian Handbook\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"💰 Treasury System\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Purpose Registry\\\",\\n        \\\"Disbursement Log\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🧮 Merit System\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Contribution Scorecard and Recognition Logic\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"📦 Distribution\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Copy logistics and dissemination protocols\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🚀 Deployment Records\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Setup instructions and activation history\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🪙 Tokenomics\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Value logic and ethical circulation\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"📚 Quraner Fariwala\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"Research\\\",\\n        \\\"Restoration\\\",\\n        \\\"Legal Continuity\\\",\\n        \\\"Campaign\\\",\\n        \\\"Donation Gateway\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"🧾 Support & Clarity\\\",\\n      \\\"items\\\": [\\n        \\\"FAQ\\\",\\n        \\\"Vision\\\",\\n        \\\"Personal Fund Declaration\\\",\\n        \\\"Public Support Page\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"nav\\\": {\\n    \\\"Home\\\": \\\"index.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Constitution\\\": \\\"constitution.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Whitepaper\\\": \\\"whitepaper.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Roadmap\\\": \\\"roadmap.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Glossary\\\": \\\"glossary.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Governance\\\": {\\n      \\\"Visionary Roles\\\": \\\"visionary-roles.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Persona Consistency\\\": \\\"behavior/persona-consistency.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Proposal Template\\\": \\\"governance/proposal-template.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Decision Tree\\\": \\\"https://github.com/mj-nexara/nexaragov-core/blob/main/decision-tree.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Voting Policy\\\": \\\"governance/voting-policy.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Emergency Protocol\\\": \\\"governance/emergency-protocol.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Ratification Process\\\": \\\"governance/ratification-process.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Ratified Actions\\\": \\\"governance/ratified-actions.md\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Treasury\\\": {\\n      \\\"Treasury Policy\\\": \\\"https://github.com/mj-nexara/nexara-treasury/blob/main/README.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Purpose Registry\\\": \\\"treasury/purpose-registry.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Disbursement Log\\\": \\\"treasury/disbursement-log.md\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Merit System\\\": \\\"merit-policy.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Deployment\\\": {\\n      \\\"Deployment Guide\\\": \\\"deployment-guide.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Deployment Record\\\": \\\"deployment-record.md\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Tokenomics\\\": \\\"tokenomics.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Security\\\": {\\n      \\\"Threat Model\\\": \\\"security/threat-model.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Audit Log Policy\\\": \\\"audit-policy.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Incident Response\\\": \\\"security/incident-response.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Guardian Handbook\\\": \\\"security/guardian-handbook.md\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"Ethics Manifesto\\\": \\\"ethics.md\\\",\\n    \\\"Community\\\": {\\n      \\\"Community Charter\\\": \\\"community-charter.md\\\",\\n      \\\"FAQ\\\": \\\"faq.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Contributing\\\": \\\"CONTRIBUTING.md\\\",\\n      \\\"Vision\\\": \\\"vision.md\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"CDE-2026-0004\",\n      \"title\": \"MJSovereign\",\n      \"title_bn\": \"\",\n      \"desc\": \"\",\n      \"desc_bn\": \"\",\n      \"filename\": \"mjs.json\",\n      \"source\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mjs.json\",\n      \"lang\": \"json\",\n      \"lang_label\": \"JSON\",\n      \"ext\": \"json\",\n      \"lines\": 30,\n      \"bytes\": 581,\n      \"sha256\": \"c64936902f6537f5aae344e44186fef9d5630dee37d3a701c3ee0cc5501a5d4a\",\n      \"menu_path\": [\n        \"codecraft\",\n        \"c-mjdocs\"\n      ],\n      \"category\": \"general\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-25T03:13:07+06:00\",\n      \"history\": [\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-25T03:13:07+06:00\",\n          \"event\": \"created\",\n          \"note\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mjs.json\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content\": \"{\\n  \\\"project\\\": \\\"MJSovereign\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"MJSovereign Ethical Governance & Finance\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\",\\n  \\\"siteType\\\": \\\"static\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"html-css-js\\\",\\n  \\\"responsive\\\": true,\\n  \\\"dashboard\\\": {\\n    \\\"name\\\": \\\"DGD\\\",\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"General Dashboard\\\",\\n    \\\"enabled\\\": true,\\n    \\\"password\\\": \\\"23542\\\",\\n    \\\"accessMode\\\": \\\"local-gate\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"roadmap\\\": {\\n    \\\"phases\\\": [\\n      \\\"Discovery\\\",\\n      \\\"Prototype\\\",\\n      \\\"Pilot\\\",\\n      \\\"Scale\\\",\\n      \\\"Legacy\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"meta\\\": {\\n    \\\"owner\\\": \\\"MJ-Ahmad\\\",\\n    \\\"repository\\\": \\\"mjs\\\",\\n    \\\"lastUpdated\\\": \\\"2026-09-01\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"CDE-2026-0005\",\n      \"title\": \"MJAhmad\",\n      \"title_bn\": \"\",\n      \"desc\": \"\",\n      \"desc_bn\": \"\",\n      \"filename\": \"mj.md\",\n      \"source\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mj.md\",\n      \"lang\": \"markdown\",\n      \"lang_label\": \"Markdown\",\n      \"ext\": \"md\",\n      \"lines\": 91,\n      \"bytes\": 3327,\n      \"sha256\": \"5c8fb888ddf74af81b82e15587355cf2ce18e51089201fa93cc431c3fca4f1e2\",\n      \"menu_path\": [\n        \"codecraft\",\n        \"c-mjdocs\"\n      ],\n      \"category\": \"general\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-09-25T03:13:57+06:00\",\n      \"history\": [\n        {\n          \"at\": \"2026-09-25T03:13:57+06:00\",\n          \"event\": \"created\",\n          \"note\": \"/data/data/com.termux/files/home/mj/mj.md\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"content\": \"2026-07-26\\n\\n---\\n\\n# **MJSovereign**\\n\\n## **The Ethical Invocation Constitution**\\n\\n“A platform for ethical governance and finance.”\\n\\n“Where every script is a verdict, every invocation a vote, and every log a legacy.”  \\n “Write the soul of a nation. Invoke the dignity of all beings.”\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Project Structure**\\n\\n* Foundational Ethos  \\n* Identity & Governance Infrastructure  \\n* Invocation & Deployment Layer  \\n* Justice & Legacy\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Foundational Ethos**\\n\\n* **Ethical engine** → A permanent software core enforcing fairness and integrity through rule-based systems and audit trails.  \\n* **Financial sovereignty** → Blockchain-driven independence with transparent ledgers, free from corruption.  \\n* **Historical anchor** → Immutable records of past ethical decisions guiding future actions.  \\n* **Purpose registry** → Smart contracts ensuring funds are distributed according to declared goals.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Identity & Governance Infrastructure**\\n\\n* **Decentralized signature engine** → Cryptographic validation for digital constitutions and agreements.  \\n* **Merit-based governance** → Authority earned through contribution, not hierarchy.  \\n* **Contribution scoring** → Algorithms recalibrating fairness in participation.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Invocation & Deployment Layer**\\n\\n* **Cloud terminals** → Sovereign-grade orchestration of cloud systems with secure access.  \\n* **AI invocation** → Lightweight AI frameworks enabling low-resource communities to benefit from intelligence.  \\n* **Ethical travel and logistics systems** → Sustainable, transparent mobility and logistics planning.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Justice & Legacy**\\n\\n* **Species-inclusive judiciary** → Legal frameworks extending rights to humans and all living beings.  \\n* **Sacred distribution** → Transparent stewardship and fair allocation of shared resources.  \\n* **Social entrepreneurship** → Microfinance and community-driven business tools for empowerment.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Master Orchestrator**\\n\\n* Role-based logic for accountability  \\n* Immutable audit logs for transparency  \\n* YAML anchors for modular configuration  \\n* Modular paths for scalable growth\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Roadmap with Milestones**\\n\\nIdea → Impact → Global adoption\\n\\n* **Idea & Conceptualization** → Define vision, principles, and target communities.  \\n* **Prototype Development** → Build a working prototype (e.g., Purpose Registry Blockchain).  \\n* **Pilot Testing** → Partner with NGOs or community projects to validate usability and trust.  \\n* **Partnerships & Early Adoption** → Collaborate with social enterprises and ethical finance groups.  \\n* **Funding & Investment** → Secure seed capital from impact investors and crowdfunding.  \\n* **Launch** → Release MVP with core modules and onboard NGOs/enterprises.  \\n* **Scaling & Expansion** → Add advanced modules (AI invocation, logistics systems) and expand globally.  \\n* **Legacy & Sustainability** → Establish governance council and position MJSovereign as a global ethical technology standard.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## **Closing Declaration**\\n\\nMJSovereign is not merely a project. It is a charter for the future.  \\n We commit to building systems that embody dignity, transparency, and resilience.  \\n We anchor innovation in ethics.  \\n We leave a legacy where technology serves humanity and all living beings.\\n\\n---\\n\\n   \\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
    }
  ]
}